{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"局部类的分类子"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"局部类"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>设 $\\Sigma$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"意象","text":"意象"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C$ 中映射的"},{"Local":{"url":"局部类","text":"局部类"}},{"Plain":" (关于"},{"Local":{"url":"基变换","text":"基变换"}},{"Plain":"与"},{"Local":{"url":"和(范畴论)","text":"余积"}},{"Plain":"封闭, 且被"},{"Local":{"url":"意象中的满射","text":"满射"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"基变换","text":"基变换"}},{"Plain":"探测).\n定义 $\\Sigma$ 的<strong>分类子</strong>为态射 $f_\\Sigma\\colon Y_\\Sigma \\to X_\\Sigma$, 又称为 $\\Sigma$ 中的<strong>万有态射</strong>, 满足 “$\\Sigma$ 的任何态射都是其基变换”; 具体地, 对任意对象 $X$,\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}(X,X_\\Sigma) \\to (\\mathcal C_{/X})^\\simeq,\r\ng\\mapsto g^*f_\\Sigma\r\n$$\n的像恰为 $\\mathcal C_{/X}$ 中由 $\\Sigma$ 中的态射构成的子"},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":". 由"},{"Local":{"url":"米田引理","text":"米田引理"}},{"Plain":", 分类子一旦存在, 就是唯一的.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>单射 ($(-1)$-"},{"Local":{"url":"截断性","text":"截断"}},{"Plain":"映射) 的分类子叫做"},{"Local":{"url":"子对象分类子","text":"子对象分类子"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}